  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Pulse the thawed peas and coriander leaves in a food processor until you have a slightly rough paste. Add the eggs, breadcrumbs and seasonings and mix. Refrigerate for 15 minutes to firm up."
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a non-stick frying pan with a little oil. Shape fritters using 2 spoons and fry for 2 minutes on each side. Drain on paper towel."
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve hot or at room temperature, ideally with seasoned yoghurt."
    }
